DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
15887::$$$message_0123_0000_0000$$$::I've finished my lunch, so maybe I'll try taking a stroll.[lr]::
15888::$$$message_0123_0000_0001$$$::The number one leisure spot in the city, Waterfront Park.[lr]::
15889::$$$message_0123_0000_0002$$$::It's the perfect date spot for couples.::
15890::$$$message_0123_0001_0000$$$::...Date? Couples?[lr]::
15891::$$$message_0123_0001_0001$$$::No, it's my precious alone time. I shouldn't think about unnecessary things. I just need to relax.[lr]::
15892::$$$message_0123_0001_0002$$$::It's a bright and good day for a nap, but it starts getting windy and chilly in the afternoon. The pleasure of being able to waste this valuable time[line len=3]::
15893::$$$message_0123_0002_0000$$$::"Hey, Emiya. What a coincidence."[lr]::
15894::$$$message_0123_0002_0001$$$::I hear a familiar voice.::
15895::$$$message_0123_0003_0000$$$::"Mitsuzuri. Are you ditching?"[lr]::
15896::$$$message_0123_0003_0001$$$::"What, practice? You talk as if I practice all the time.[lr]::
15897::$$$message_0123_0003_0002$$$::That being said, you were way more serious about it than I was in the past."[lr]::
15898::$$$message_0123_0003_0003$$$::"And you were the one who was working hard so that you wouldn't lose to me."[lr]::
15899::$$$message_0123_0003_0004$$$::[font italic=true]Was I that passionate?[font italic=false] I was so busy with my part-time job and housework that my impression of the archery range is faint to be honest.::
15900::$$$message_0123_0004_0000$$$::"Really? Even among the main current members, there is no one that comes out to the archery range more than you and I did.[lr]::
15901::$$$message_0123_0004_0001$$$::You're working a part-time job, and you're helping out the student council for some reason, so we were wondering when you have time to have fun."::
15902::$$$message_0123_0005_0000$$$::"Aren't you also like that, too?"[lr]::
15903::$$$message_0123_0005_0001$$$::"My work and play mode are distinct, so I get refreshed where people won't see me.[cacheimage storage=美綴私服01a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=美綴私服01a(中) time=300 textoff=0]"::
15904::$$$message_0123_0006_0000$$$::"I also keep my studying, part-time job, and free time separate."[lr]::
15905::$$$message_0123_0006_0001$$$::"I don't know about that.[lr]::
15906::$$$message_0123_0006_0002$$$::Instead of work and play, you're like work, work, work."[lr]::
15907::$$$message_0123_0006_0003$$$::Mitsuzuri laughs in a refreshing manner.[lr]::
15908::$$$message_0123_0006_0004$$$::People say to keep a good work-life balance, but in actuality, I don't really know how. Resting is also part of work[line len=3]::
15909::$$$message_0123_0007_0000$$$::"That's what I thought, but...you seem to be having fun like a different person. Do you have a date or something today? You waiting for someone? Hm?"[lr]::
15910::$$$message_0123_0007_0001$$$::"Mrgh."[lr]::
15911::$$$message_0123_0007_0002$$$::Just as I was thinking she's unnecessarily sharp, she says that.[lr]::
15912::$$$message_0123_0007_0003$$$::Going on a date? Well, I can't say that I don't go on them.::
15913::$$$message_0123_0008_0000$$$::"Hold on. Doesn't the way you say that make me sound like Shinji?"[lr]::
15914::$$$message_0123_0008_0001$$$::"Hahaha, he has too much fun.[lr]::
15915::$$$message_0123_0008_0002$$$::Well, if you act a bit more like Shinji, that would make me feel a bit better."[lr]::
15916::$$$message_0123_0008_0003$$$::The difference between being disgusted and relieved is subtle.[lr]::
15917::$$$message_0123_0008_0004$$$::...Well, she's also by herself even while saying that, too.::
15918::$$$message_0123_0009_0000$$$::"So you're in the middle of meeting up with someone for a date."[lr]::
15919::$$$message_0123_0009_0001$$$::"Me? With who? Where?"[lr]::
15920::$$$message_0123_0009_0002$$$::"...Why don't you try bluffing and act like you have a partner...can't you react in a cute way like that?"::
15921::$$$message_0123_0010_0000$$$::"What's with you, Emiya? Before, you would just act cool and say, 'I see.' [cacheimage storage=美綴私服02b(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=美綴私服02b(中) time=300 textoff=0]Do you now love soft girls that are into dates or something?"[lr]::
15922::$$$message_0123_0010_0001$$$::"...That's not what I meant. Either way, you're by yourself."[lr]::
15923::$$$message_0123_0010_0002$$$::"Likewise. But... I see."[lr]::
15924::$$$message_0123_0010_0003$$$::Mitsuzuri nods repeatedly.[lr]::
15925::$$$message_0123_0010_0004$$$::As though eventually convinced...she claps her hands together.::
15926::$$$message_0123_0011_0000$$$::"All right, this is also fate. Go out with me instead of Tohsaka."[lr]::
15927::$$$message_0123_0011_0001$$$::"What... Me g-going out with you?"[lr]::
15928::$$$message_0123_0011_0002$$$::"I'm saying to go out shopping with me. [cacheimage storage=美綴私服01b(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=美綴私服01b(中) time=300 textoff=0]Well, it's rare for you and me to be together, so keeping me company like this isn't bad once in a while, right?"::
15929::$$$message_0123_0012_0000$$$::What came back in response to my murmur is a rather manly reply. In fact, I feel like Issei has more feminine euphemisms.[lr]::
15930::$$$message_0123_0012_0001$$$::As I'm convinced about that, Mitsuzuri pouts in dissatisfaction.::
15931::$$$message_0123_0013_0000$$$::"...What, am I not good enough for you?"[lr]::
15932::$$$message_0123_0013_0001$$$::"No one said that."[lr]::
15933::$$$message_0123_0013_0002$$$::"Yeah, you always have Matou, Tohsaka, or Saber by your side. So I'm not enough to fill their place. You're too picky, Emiya. Do you understand that much? Here's to giving up on you, kid."::
15934::$$$message_0123_0014_0000$$$::"If you desire someone beautiful, I'll introduce you to Rider."[lr]::
15935::$$$message_0123_0014_0001$$$::"Wah."[lr]::
15936::$$$message_0123_0014_0002$$$::She shuts up, as I mention her weak subject.[lr]::
15937::$$$message_0123_0014_0003$$$::How do I say this? It's more like Rider wants to rent Mitsuzuri.::
15938::$$$message_0123_0015_0000$$$::"T-That's fine. F-First of all, Rider isn't yours, but Matou's chaperone."[lr]::
15939::$$$message_0123_0015_0001$$$::"I'm sure Sakura would agree without hesitating if I ask.[lr]::
15940::$$$message_0123_0015_0002$$$::Well, lending and borrowing aside, what are we doing today? Where are we going?"[lr]::
15941::$$$message_0123_0015_0003$$$::The conversation seems to be going in a weird direction, so I turn the steering wheel with force, or rather, turn it back.::
15942::$$$message_0123_0016_0000$$$::"All right, well, I'm sure you ate already, so keep me company while I get some tea. After that, we're going through records at the CD store and then going to the arcade."[lr]::
15943::$$$message_0123_0016_0001$$$::"Is that invite knowing that I'm not good with the blip bleep atmosphere of those game playing facilities?"[lr]::
15944::$$$message_0123_0016_0002$$$::I can only play games like shogi or Tycoon... As I'm vaguely filled with anxiety, Mitsuzuri sighs.::
15945::$$$message_0123_0017_0000$$$::"Geez. Both you and Tohsaka are so old-fashioned that it's unbelievable in this day and age. Matou is actually pretty[line len=2]"[lr]::
15946::$$$message_0123_0017_0001$$$::"...Hey, I'm nowhere near how old-fashioned Tohsaka is."[lr]::
15947::$$$message_0123_0017_0002$$$::I attempt to object.[lr]::
15948::$$$message_0123_0017_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=美綴私服02a(中) textoff=0]Can I exchange my practical skills of fixing a machine that's broken down to screws with using electrical appliances on a daily basis? ::
15949::$$$message_0123_0018_0000$$$::"Say those kinds of things once you at least have a cell phone. Although I can't imagine you sending texts either."[lr]::
15950::$$$message_0123_0018_0001$$$::Very true.::
15951::$$$message_0123_0019_0000$$$::"...Hmm. I guess I should have a cell phone after all. Ms. Neko tells me that every time I see her."[lr]::
15952::$$$message_0123_0019_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri looks at me in confusion, hearing "Ms. Neko."::
15953::$$$message_0123_0020_0000$$$::"The person at my part-time job. Fuji-nee's classmate from long ago."[lr]::
15954::$$$message_0123_0020_0001$$$::"Oh, that lady at Copenhagen. Yeah. You need to contact her about your shifts and stuff, right?" [lr]::
15955::$$$message_0123_0020_0002$$$::"In my case, it's like helping out with all kinds of stuff outside of work."[lr]::
15956::$$$message_0123_0020_0003$$$::So, maybe I shouldn't get one after all...::
15957::$$$message_0123_0021_0000$$$::"Well, then that's your own choice and your own life. [cacheimage storage=美綴私服01b(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=美綴私服01b(中) time=300 textoff=0]I'm sure it's a matter of time."[lr]::
15958::$$$message_0123_0021_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri laughs. She really laughs like she's having fun. So[line len=3][lr]::
15959::$$$message_0123_0021_0002$$$::"I need to teach you about that kind of stuff. Make sure to bring Tohsaka to the next class."[lr]::
15960::$$$message_0123_0021_0003$$$::"...She'll run away."::
15961::$$$message_0123_0022_0000$$$::If the teacher, Mitsuzuri, looks at Tohsaka all smug... I bet she'll be muttering from start to finish, overcome with defeat.::
15962::$$$message_0123_0023_0000$$$::"I see. If I teach you and Saber first, then it's better for her if we tell her that she's the only one that doesn't know... Let's see."[lr]::
15963::$$$message_0123_0023_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri is nodding while smirking, as she thinks of a brainwashing plan. Nevertheless, she's going up against that stubborn Tohsaka... Good luck. I wouldn't be able to.::
15964::$$$message_0123_0024_0000$$$::"Well anyway, let's go to the arcade.[lr]::
15965::$$$message_0123_0024_0001$$$::I'm sure we'd be able to have a good match if it's something hands-on, yeah."[lr]::
15966::$$$message_0123_0024_0002$$$::Oh yeah, that's what she was saying... Hands-on?[lr]::
15967::$$$message_0123_0024_0003$$$::Even if I were to go to the arcade with Mitsuzuri, the only ones I'd be able to play are...::
15968::$$$message_0123_0025_0000$$$::"What about that shooting one?"[lr]::
15969::$$$message_0123_0025_0001$$$::"Good idea, I bet you'd be good at those. Maybe we actually won't die and have to pay more to continue.[lr]::
15970::$$$message_0123_0025_0002$$$::Anyway, let's head to the front of the train station. I'll at least treat you to tea."[lr]::
15971::$$$message_0123_0025_0003$$$::"...No, please let me split the bill."::
15972::$$$message_0123_0026_0000$$$::I follow Mitsuzuri who starts walking.[lr]::
15973::$$$message_0123_0026_0001$$$::...Isn't this a date after all? I think that to myself, but[line len=3]maybe it's better left unsaid.::
15974::$$$message_0123_0027_0000$$$::"C'mon, Emiya, don't be zoning out! It's my first time going to an arcade with a guy! Oh yeah, let's measure our punch strength!"[lr]::
15975::$$$message_0123_0027_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri hurries me, as if she's having too much fun.[lr]::
15976::$$$message_0123_0027_0002$$$::...This is far from a date.::
915893::$$$message_9123_0002_0000$$$::"Hey, Emiya. What a coincidence."[r]::